  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#fc0\"><strong>Supplementaries&sup2;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是为 Supplementaries 模组制作的插件，旨在为其部分方块添加变体，并加入一些未能进入主模组的杂项功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">主要功能包括：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">彩色帆布袋</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">木质变体物品架</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">金色烛台</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">灰泥楼梯和墙</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">金属框架</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">牌匾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">重钥匙（与普通钥匙类似，但无法重命名，且合成时唯一）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">铜灯笼和绯红灯笼</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组占用了我大量的时间，如果您喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以通过以下方式赞助。如果您这样做，您将收到专为您定制的<strong>地球仪</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果您使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用此优惠。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器吗？看看 Akliz，他们提供专为模组版 Minecraft 打造的高端品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有非常温馨的社区、出色的技术支持，服务器体验极佳。<br>使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享受<strong>8折优惠</strong>，同时也能支持到我！</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><sp